              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and light armour. Rides a horse. May have heavy armour (+2 pts) &amp; either shield (+2 pts) or buckler (+1 pt). The horse may be barded (+4 pts). 0-1. (Byzantium p.47)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
