              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear and large shield. Combined Formation - Spearmen may combine with up to 50% archers, who are placed in either the rear or the front ranks. Spearmen combined with archers may exchange large shields for Cane Shields (+1 pt) - Spearmen with Cane Shields may form a Cane Shieldwall. Levied spearmen count as Levies. (Byzantium p.48)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="8158-1247-a8da-0e6d" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">5+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
